      "name": "Rambling Dwarven Survivor",
      "role": "",
      "faction": "",
      "description": "A disheveled, wild-eyed dwarf in patched armor, muttering about monsters beneath the ground. He is wary but desperate for help—and may offer warnings, rumors, or even a crude map of the Marches if befriended.",
